abstract: >-
  ThermalSight is a specialized clinical and biomechanical thermal imaging research
  suite designed for radiometric temperature extraction, multi-region polygonal segmentation,
  and spatial-temporal thermal gradient evaluation (PPP, PPG, and PGA triad metrics).
  It provides dual execution environments: an offline standalone desktop application
  (Electron with native Python scientific engine) and an interactive trial web client
  (Nano Engine) hosted on GitHub Pages.
